		<header class="entry-header">

			<h1 class="entry-title">Google Reviews for Clinics in Dubai: The DHA-Safe Guide</h1><div class="entry-meta">By <span class="posted-by vcard author">			<a title="View all posts by Abu Bakar"
				href="/our-blog/" rel="author"
				class="url fn n"				>
				<span
				class="author-name"				>
				Abu Bakar			</span>
			</a>
		</span>

		 / <span class="posted-on"><span class="published"> October 12, 2026 </span></span></div>

